y be stricter than its organization and never more permissive: *"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self::sensitive_scopes_enabled"},{"type":"text","text":"], validated "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disable-only"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — the mirror image of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"mfa_enforced","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", because releasing personal data is the less-restrictive direction, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tenant can turn its organization’s decision off but never on. *","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dynamic_registration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"], on the ladder ","type":"text"},{"code":"disabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" → ","type":"text"},{"code":"initial_access_token","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" →","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"anonymous","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a tenant may move down it and never up. * [","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dcr_max_clients","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[","type":"text"},{"code":"Self::dcr_unused_client_ttl_days","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"], on the ordinary ","type":"text"},{"code":"tenant <= org","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rule — with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wrinkle that ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the second means ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"never sweep"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", which is the longest window of all and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is handled by [","type":"text"},{"code":"dcr_ttl_strictness","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"]. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not ordered","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", therefore never validated against the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"tex